OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening with rain spreading from the
OL,7,Fwest across all parts. Turning drier
OL,8,Fand clearer in the early hours.
OL,9,FShowers spreading the west later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FWindy with showers, these
OL,13,Fblustery and occasionally heavy. Some
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain in the
OL,15,Fnorthwest. Strong west or
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
