OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA few
OL,6,Fearly showers on Friday before rain
OL,7,Fspreads northeast in the afternoon.
OL,8,FBright spells and showers on Saturday,
OL,9,Fturning drier on Sunday. Strong west
OL,10,For southwesterly winds Friday,
OL,11,FSaturday.
